  "rationale": "The plant automata G1 models the robot's perception-action cycle, including all motion commands and sensor outcomes. The specification automata E1 enforces safe, conservative exploration: random_walk is used in clear/search states, move_forward is only allowed in a short forward_commit state, and all obstacle events force deterministic turn-based recovery (never left turns). Obstacle recovery states never allow move_forward or random_walk. The design ensures only one controllable is enabled per non-terminal state, and all uncontrollables are total. No infinite controllable loops or unsafe transitions are present.",
